
--- stdout ---
Usage: image --model PATH --prompt TEXT --output PATH [OPTIONS]
  --backend cpu|webgpu   Compute backend (default: cpu)
  --width N --height N   Multiples of 64, 64..4096 (default: 512)
  --steps N             Sampling steps, 1..1000 (default: 20)
  --seed N              Reproducible seed, 0..INT64_MAX (default: 42)
  --threads N           CPU threads, 1..256 (default: native core count)
  --cfg-scale F         Finite guidance scale, 0..100 (default: 7)
  --negative-prompt TEXT  Negative conditioning (default: empty)
  --sampler NAME        Native sampler (default: model default)
  --scheduler NAME      Native scheduler (default: model default)
  --vae PATH            Optional separate VAE weights
Saves one PNG. Model and output paths must be explicit.
WebGPU uses embedded software Vulkan and permits GGML CPU fallback
for unsupported operators; execution counters measure WebGPU work.
Flash attention and SageAttention are disabled by default.

